Third-party components

src/ductus/engines/diffbrush/*.py  - from DiffBrush (Gang Dai et al.), MIT.
                                     See src/ductus/engines/diffbrush/LICENSE-DiffBrush.
src/ductus/engines/diffbrush/glyphs.npz - 16x16 glyphs for 80 ASCII characters taken
                                     from GNU Unifont via DiffBrush (Unifont: SIL OFL 1.1 /
                                     GPLv2+ with font embedding exception).
src/ductus/presets/*.png           - rendered from strokes sampled with the pretrained RNN of
                                     Grzego/handwriting-generation (MIT).

Model weights are NOT included. They are downloaded on first use:
  DiffBrush checkpoint  - released by its authors; trained on the IAM Handwriting
                          Database, whose terms allow non-commercial research use.
  Stable Diffusion 1.5 VAE - CreativeML OpenRAIL-M.
  TrOCR base handwritten   - MIT (Microsoft).
Check those terms before any commercial use of generated output.
